# Direct Python dependencies of the OCR sidecar. This file is the one humans
# edit; requirements.txt is the compiled, hash-pinned lock the Containerfile
# installs. Regenerate after ANY change here:
#
#   mise run lock-ocr-sidecar
#
# PyMuPDF does the PDF rasterisation (what Unlimited-OCR's own `infer.py --pdf`
# does internally) and ships the `fitz` module the server imports.
pymupdf
